These Markdown files are an ILLUSTRATIVE NVMe corpus written for this repository, in our own words,
so the pipeline, tests and evaluation can run without downloading anything. Section numbers are
local to these files and do NOT match the official specification, and details are simplified.

For real use, download the NVM Express specifications (free) from https://nvmexpress.org/specifications/
— e.g. the NVM Express Base Specification and the NVM Command Set Specification — and index them:

    python -m scripts.ingest path/to/specs/ --rebuild
